  "raw_label": "appellant_lost",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "M/S.S.S.Essence Pvt Ltd vs State Rep. By Its on 23 February, 2024 Author: T.V.Thamilselvi Bench: T.V.Thamilselvi Crl.O.P.No. In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated : 23.02.2024 Coram: The Hon'Ble Mrs.Justice T.V.Thamilselvi Crl.O.P.No.12309 of 2022 and Crl.M.P.Nos.6875 & 6876 of 2022 M/s.S.S.Essence Pvt Ltd., rep. by ts Director Surendran N.P. ... Petiti Versus State rep. by its Food Safety Officer, Melvisaram, Ranipet Municipality, Code No.506, Authorised Officer, Tamil Nadu Food Safety and Standard Act Department, Drug Administration Department, nd 2 Floor, B Block, Collector Office Building Vellore Dt.-632 009. ... Respon Prayer : Criminal Original Petition filed under Section 482 of the Code of Criminal Procedure, to call for the records relating to S.T.C.No.763 of 2018 on the file of District Munsif cum Judicial Magistrate, Ranipet and quash the same with regard to the petitione Page No.1 of 5 M/S.S.S.Essence Pvt Ltd vs State Rep. By Its on 23 February, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/111453648/ 1 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis Crl For Petitioner : Mr.T.Muruganantham For Respondent : Mr.S.Vinoth Kumar, Govt. Advocate (Crl. Si ORDER",
    "facts": "While so, on 24.09.2017, when the respondent visited his shop and found tobacco products weighing 520 kgs. in 13 small pockets, which were banned items in Tamil Nadu and the petitioner was asked about the address and other particulars of tobacco product manufacturer, he did not disclose the same. Hence, the petitioner was charged under Sec.27 of the Act along with 58, 59(1) of Food Safety and Standard Act.",
    "arguments": "4. The learned counsel for petitioner would submit that he is having valid license at Karnataka and based on that only, he manufactured the scented tobacco, besides sanction was obtained within 14 days from the date of sample order. Therefore, the proceedings initiated by the respondent under Sec.58, 59(1) of Food Safety and Standard Act, 2006 is tainted with illegality and the same is liable to be [LEAKAGE_MASK]."
  },
